    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for report. Didn't need to ask for reproducible example, because it turned out I experience this in my setup too. Just didn't notice :)\r\n\r\nHowever, the reason seems to be the lazy loading of some other plugin which cleans command line. If you try `nvim --clean -u minimal-starter.lua' which only loads 'mini.starter', the query does not disappear.\r\n\r\nDo you suggest an option to completely remove all \"current query\" messages at the bottom because they are not useful to you?\r\n\r\nI'll see what I can do.",
            "created_at": "2022-04-22T12:48:36Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/64#issuecomment-1106481089",
            "id": 1106481089,
